{"3636510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Heartwake", "steam_appid": 3636510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/955455938a19091846d455932f445f2d.avif?t=1787144127\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras_big/955455938a19091846d455932f445f2d.avif?t=1787144127 width=1560 height=718 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> A HOME IN THE STORM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until recently this was a quiet, beautiful island. Then The Tornado came. It tears apart the rhythms of daily life and leaves gloom behind it. Shelter the island, uncover what The Tornado really is, and work out how to drive it away. One repair at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START THE ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an island that keeps its secrets close, and find out why The Tornado is so strong and why it refuses to leave. How do you shelter from it? Can it be driven off at all? Search for traces of what came before, solve the puzzles they hide, and piece the truth together. Somewhere in it is the way to bring color back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/c097d6876f29c998b849de643b425eb7.avif?t=1787144127\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras_big/c097d6876f29c998b849de643b425eb7.avif?t=1787144127 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS THAT GROW WITH YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is home to a colorful and sometimes strange cast of locals. From helpful engineers to curious spirits, each has their own struggles, stories, and part to play in the island's recovery. They offer quests, companionship, and guidance, and your relationship with them shifts based on how you play. Expect quirky moments, small surprises, and deeper connections as you restore hope together. Your kindness matters here, more than you might think.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft everything you need: tools, gear, furniture, and supplies. Tame animals and set up simple caravan routes to move goods between outposts. Decorate your home base. Experiment with recipes. The island becomes what you make of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/cbb4211aa7a4e287159f4995e958b7b8.poster.avif?t=1787144127\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/cbb4211aa7a4e287159f4995e958b7b8.webm?t=1787144127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/cbb4211aa7a4e287159f4995e958b7b8.mp4?t=1787144127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY AT YOUR OWN PACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartwake is a single-player adventure designed to let you play your way. No timers, no failure states, no pressure to rush. Focus on crafting and decoration, dive into the storylines, or reclaim the island region by region. The island will wait for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.poster.avif?t=1787144127\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.webm?t=1787144127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.mp4?t=1787144127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/955455938a19091846d455932f445f2d.avif?t=1787144127\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras_big/955455938a19091846d455932f445f2d.avif?t=1787144127 width=1560 height=718 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> A HOME IN THE STORM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until recently this was a quiet, beautiful island. Then The Tornado came. It tears apart the rhythms of daily life and leaves gloom behind it. Shelter the island, uncover what The Tornado really is, and work out how to drive it away. One repair at a time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START THE ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an island that keeps its secrets close, and find out why The Tornado is so strong and why it refuses to leave. How do you shelter from it? Can it be driven off at all? Search for traces of what came before, solve the puzzles they hide, and piece the truth together. Somewhere in it is the way to bring color back to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/c097d6876f29c998b849de643b425eb7.avif?t=1787144127\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras_big/c097d6876f29c998b849de643b425eb7.avif?t=1787144127 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHARACTERS THAT GROW WITH YOU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is home to a colorful and sometimes strange cast of locals. From helpful engineers to curious spirits, each has their own struggles, stories, and part to play in the island's recovery. They offer quests, companionship, and guidance, and your relationship with them shifts based on how you play. Expect quirky moments, small surprises, and deeper connections as you restore hope together. Your kindness matters here, more than you might think.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR ISLAND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft everything you need: tools, gear, furniture, and supplies. Tame animals and set up simple caravan routes to move goods between outposts. Decorate your home base. Experiment with recipes. The island becomes what you make of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/cbb4211aa7a4e287159f4995e958b7b8.poster.avif?t=1787144127\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/cbb4211aa7a4e287159f4995e958b7b8.webm?t=1787144127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/cbb4211aa7a4e287159f4995e958b7b8.mp4?t=1787144127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PLAY AT YOUR OWN PACE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heartwake is a single-player adventure designed to let you play your way. No timers, no failure states, no pressure to rush. Focus on crafting and decoration, dive into the storylines, or reclaim the island region by region. The island will wait for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.poster.avif?t=1787144127\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.webm?t=1787144127\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/extras/5d6ec27aa0782ea4cb1b95adc9dd675a.mp4?t=1787144127\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "A cozy single-player crafting adventure where every repair brightens the island and every friendship weakens the gloom. Explore a storm-battered coast, befriend the locals, rebuild what was lost, and find the way to stop The Tornado.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/29b73d25416062bd676afd900312c8cfb27422aa/header.jpg?t=1787144127", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/81270255b9442b74c36fb63f40458b94a08f64f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787144127", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636510/81270255b9442b74c36fb63f40458b94a08f64f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787144127", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit / Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 (3.3Ghz) or AMD Ryzen 5 1400 (3.2Ghz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 580 8GB<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Int